    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD2EB087D5275EB00818A50D7C89722DE" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Please refer to the "Notes to Financial Statements" included in the 2025 Annual FERC Form 1 of Fitchburg Gas and Electric Light Company, which begin on page 123.1 of that report.&#160; Also, please refer to the Notes to the Consolidated Financial Statements of the 2025 Form 10-K of Unitil Corporation and the Form 10-Q of Unitil Corporation for the period ended March 31, 2026 as filed with the United States Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
